{"4783060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RogueOut Racing", "steam_appid": 4783060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>RogueOut Racing is a high-speed arcade racing experience built on precision, control, and pure velocity.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your skills to the limit in intense anti-gravity racing challenges where smooth handling, precise control, and split-second decisions define victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle every track by studying the best racing lines, optimize your runs, and fight for the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a stylized universe that blends diverse worlds with a strong cel-shaded visual identity, RogueOut Racing combines futuristic aesthetics with high-speed arcade gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through vast and open environments where routes are laid out across large dynamic spaces, creating a sense of freedom while maintaining a competitive structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deep movement system featuring boost mechanics, heat and energy management, hull integrity, and responsive vehicle control. Every system is designed to reward precise driving, creating a solid experience that rewards player skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your limits, race against the times of the best players on the leaderboards while watching their movements, or challenge friends in local split-screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every millisecond counts as you refine your performance and climb the rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite vehicle, each with unique characteristics to match your driving style and different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>High-speed precision racing</strong></i> <br>Experience extreme velocities with a physics-driven control system designed for smooth, responsive handling.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Global leaderboards &amp; ghost racing</strong></i> <br>Race against recorded ghost data from top players and push your limits to climb the worldwide rankings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Split-screen multiplayer</strong></i> <br>Challenge friends locally in competitive split-screen races built for intense head-to-head gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unique environments</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through vast and open environments that blend different styles and cultures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Boost, turbo &amp; heat management systems</strong></i> <br>Strategically manage speed, temperature, and hull integrity to maintain peak performance during high-intensity races.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stylized universe</strong></i> <br>Set in a stylized universe with a cel-shaded visual identity, blending sci-fi elements with a variety of distinct environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hover-based racing vehicles</strong></i> <br>Pilot customizable hover ships designed for responsiveness, precision, and competitive control.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>RogueOut Racing is a high-speed arcade racing experience built on precision, control, and pure velocity.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your skills to the limit in intense anti-gravity racing challenges where smooth handling, precise control, and split-second decisions define victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle every track by studying the best racing lines, optimize your runs, and fight for the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/7de457749dd86be7472303d704eb658e.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a stylized universe that blends diverse worlds with a strong cel-shaded visual identity, RogueOut Racing combines futuristic aesthetics with high-speed arcade gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through vast and open environments where routes are laid out across large dynamic spaces, creating a sense of freedom while maintaining a competitive structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/5623b7c3970fc5d7db1472b5fc8b1ad2.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deep movement system featuring boost mechanics, heat and energy management, hull integrity, and responsive vehicle control. Every system is designed to reward precise driving, creating a solid experience that rewards player skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/d5baf83fef2f0e8f275b475b0d1773f2.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your limits, race against the times of the best players on the leaderboards while watching their movements, or challenge friends in local split-screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every millisecond counts as you refine your performance and climb the rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/951cac1ed76518e7257b06c3d899a924.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite vehicle, each with unique characteristics to match your driving style and different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.poster.avif?t=1781618491\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.webm?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4783060/extras/e709e3bb6053e28177fea743d5f1646f.mp4?t=1781618491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>High-speed precision racing</strong></i> <br>Experience extreme velocities with a physics-driven control system designed for smooth, responsive handling.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Global leaderboards &amp; ghost racing</strong></i> <br>Race against recorded ghost data from top players and push your limits to climb the worldwide rankings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Split-screen multiplayer</strong></i> <br>Challenge friends locally in competitive split-screen races built for intense head-to-head gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unique environments</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through vast and open environments that blend different styles and cultures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Boost, turbo &amp; heat management systems</strong></i> <br>Strategically manage speed, temperature, and hull integrity to maintain peak performance during high-intensity races.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stylized universe</strong></i> <br>Set in a stylized universe with a cel-shaded visual identity, blending sci-fi elements with a variety of distinct environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hover-based racing vehicles</strong></i> <br>Pilot customizable hover ships designed for responsiveness, precision, and competitive control.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "RogueOut Racing is a high-speed arcade racing experience inspired by the classics. Race at impossible speeds, master challenging tracks, and dominate the online leaderboards across diverse and unique environments.", "supported_languages": "English<stron